  "slug": "lily-learns-chinese",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/19332_lily-learns-chinese.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Lily is a French person, and Li Li is her Chinese name. She studied Chinese in France. She has two Chinese teachers from China, one is a male teacher and the other is a female teacher. They took classes together, spoke Chinese together, drank coffee and watched movies together, and became very good friends."
  ],
  "english_full": "Lily is a French person, and Li Li is her Chinese name. She studied Chinese in France. She has two Chinese teachers from China, one is a male teacher and the other is a female teacher. They took classes together, spoke Chinese together, drank coffee and watched movies together, and became very good friends.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Ли́лия — францу́зская ли́чность, а ли Ли — её кита́йское и́мя. Она учи́ла кита́йский в Фра́нции. У неё две кита́йские наста́вницы из Кита́я, одна — мужско́й наста́вник, а дру́гая — же́нский наста́вник. Они́ занимались вме́сте, гова́рили на кита́йском вме́сте, пили кофе и смотрели филь́мы вме́сте и ста́ли хо́рошими дру́зьями."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Líliya — frantsúzskaya líchnost', a li Li — yėyo kitáyskoe ímya. Ona uchila kitáyskiy v Frańtsii. U neyo dve kitáyskie nast́avnitsy iz Kitáya, odna — muzhskóy nast́avnik, a drúgaya — zhenskíy nast́avnik. Oni zanimalis' vmeste, gov́arili na kitáyskom vmeste, pili kofe i smotréli fíl'my vmeste i stali khóroshimi drúzyami."
  ],
  "ruby_paragraphs": [
